{%- comment -%} Corporate gifting FAQ accordion with FAQPage structured data. Answers match /pages/faq. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture faqs -%}
What is the minimum order quantity for corporate gifts?|Just 10 pieces for branded corporate gifts, workable for startups and enterprises alike. Artisanal mementos and festive hampers can be ordered as single pieces.~Can you put our company logo on the gifts?|Yes. Laser engraving, UV print, full-colour print, foil stamping and embossing are available on nearly every product. Send your logo in any format and our designers will prepare it.~Do we approve the design before production?|Always. We send a digital mock-up of the branding, engraving or hamper layout for your written approval before production begins.~How long does an order take?|Standard turnaround is 5–7 working days after artwork approval. Delivery adds about 2 days within Bengaluru, about 5 days across Karnataka and up to 2 weeks pan-India. Express options are available for urgent orders.~What is a good budget per corporate gift?|Branded essentials start under ₹500, most welcome kits and hampers sit between ₹1,000 and ₹2,500, and premium leadership or client gifts go above ₹5,000. Share your budget and we will curate within it.~Do you provide GST invoices and handle POs?|Yes. We are GST-registered and a GeM-registered vendor. B2B invoices, advance receipts and purchase orders are routine for us.~Can you deliver to multiple addresses across India?|Yes. We ship tracked via BlueDart, DTDC and Delhivery with double-boxed packing, and can deliver to individual employee addresses or in bulk to your offices.~How does payment work?|50% advance to start production and the balance before dispatch. We accept UPI, bank transfer and cards.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign rows = faqs | strip | split: '~' -%}
<style>
  .mg-faq { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: .65rem; }
  .mg-faq details { border: 1px solid var(--mg-line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--mg-surface); }
  .mg-faq details[open] { border-color: var(--mg-line-gold); }
  .mg-faq summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #faf7f0; font-size: .97rem; }
  .mg-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .mg-faq summary::after { content: "+"; color: var(--mg-gold); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1; flex: none; transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .mg-faq details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .mg-faq summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--mg-gold); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 12px; }
  .mg-faq__a { padding: 0 1.2rem 1.1rem; color: var(--mg-muted); line-height: 1.65; font-size: .92rem; margin: 0; }
  .mg-faq__more { text-align: center; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
</style>
<section aria-labelledby="mg-faq-h">
  <div class="mg-head">
    <p class="mg-head__eyebrow">Good to know</p>
    <h2 class="mg-head__title" id="mg-faq-h">Corporate gifting FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="mg-faq">
    {%- for r in rows -%}
      {%- assign qa = r | split: '|' -%}
      <details{% if forloop.first %} open{% endif %}><summary>{{ qa[0] }}</summary><p class="mg-faq__a">{{ qa[1] }}</p></details>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  <p class="mg-faq__more"><a class="mg-link" href="/pages/faq">See all FAQs →</a></p>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{%- for r in rows -%}{%- assign qa = r | split: '|' -%}{"@type":"Question","name":{{ qa[0] | json }},"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":{{ qa[1] | json }}}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}]}
</script>
